{"id":"n90584-1-13","stage":4,"title":"양손 · 两手","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90584-1-13-1","ko":"짐이 무거우니까 양손으로 받으렴.","zh":"东西很重，用双手接住吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"짐이","meaning":"担子","explanation":"짐：担子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71357","senseId":"2","lemma":"짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짐이","audio":"/audio/add0f4fadc4e9cc274b8.mp3"}},{"text":"무거우니까","meaning":"重，沉","explanation":"무겁다：重，沉；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"무겁다","audio":"/audio/91e3eab0a3ea6c9e4a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58159","senseId":"1","lemma":"무겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무거우니까","audio":"/audio/bec88dd4dd23aecc4d69.mp3"}},{"text":"양손으로","meaning":"两手","explanation":"양손：两手；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"양손","audio":"/audio/405e07c1ddf05afa2980.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90584","senseId":"1","lemma":"양손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양손으로","audio":"/audio/23a5b6e80d2fd0e04043.mp3"}},{"text":"받으렴.","meaning":"接，接住","explanation":"받다：接，接住；으렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"6","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받으렴","audio":"/audio/81f761eec53ee19a8468.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3d95bbb883f1e751","term":"짐","zh":"担子","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3","entryId":"71357","definition":"承担的责任或负担。","pronunciation":["짐"]},{"id":"91e3eab0a3ea6c9e","term":"무겁다","zh":"重，沉","audio":"/audio/91e3eab0a3ea6c9e4a4d.mp3","entryId":"58159","definition":"重量大。","pronunciation":["무겁따"]},{"id":"405e07c1ddf05afa","term":"양손","zh":"两手","audio":"/audio/405e07c1ddf05afa2980.mp3","entryId":"90584","definition":"两只手。","pronunciation":["양ː손"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接，接住","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"用手抓住从空中落下或向自己飞过来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8200a3bfa05e897c0130.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90584-1-13-2","ko":"네. 두 손으로 잘 받을게요.","zh":"好的，我会用双手好好接住的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"손으로","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손으로","audio":"/audio/76c1e0d34bb2dfa1de41.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"받을게요.","meaning":"接，接住","explanation":"받다：接，接住；을게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"6","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받을게요","audio":"/audio/6fc655b9ab8c1bb28c96.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciat